{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30007_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:30a7abd437fc900438e512dd8572c822503e88a9f530bbc5baabcedab4967bf7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f17ce21180932fca79237686063b2e9cce44c4db32232a7260ce1a1479ea0cd",
      "text": "差不多该进正题了吧。大家的资料都在手边了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:603519c4925177eb4df1d9d1ec6fa5f8407e06b7f404aaf635e13cd3817bb2af",
      "text": "齐了！\n上面都写了些什么呢。让我瞧瞧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:320bd0497c88bbf945b9b33b1fc1ec8bc85b5d57177585d8994c7594c328bcc7",
      "text": "大家想看的内容，好像还挺丰富的。\n……啊，这边还有指名企划呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b63f6a29c5898eeeb908c3daabe9facd6dc5ea082c2dc0ac2c99ace0f5624ef3",
      "text": "做饭、绘画对决、还有捉迷藏吗！\n噢噢噢噢！引人注目的企划太多了，真让人纠结啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98c6e5548d8770dadcf0c131532822b1b46e7892e2f4a42dadbbae0a2be806d5",
      "text": "啊，看样子一时半会儿是定不下来了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f7aa3332edaa2e201cf053061741bbef2cdf0d368a56e4c4f5ad570d20d51d5",
      "text": "那么，就由我来归纳大家的意见吧。\n可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d57075faeb85b5ffa38795f5027dc2436fa4c8e63e9bd458fb990425d8bca70",
      "text": "嗯，当然可以。\n那接下来就交给你了，锐心君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:056d511f74169a4738dd351b08982a80570c9e22a87011ba7e6019d883e6f537",
      "text": "（哇～真不愧是著名的学生会长！在这种时候，\n能唰地站出来主持大局，太帅了吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bded1d48b85006462e2d10f1b3d243fee54a5a475408f3d6bf39d128c5622a2",
      "text": "（这堂堂正正的气魄。隔着话语都能感受到，\n他绝对是在学校里当老大的料啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6e0abb4b18422d4f279a5ac6349b94ce28bacb0dca2c0c7f3598b6fd3632b07",
      "text": "其他视频里，选取的题材基本都契合了\n各个队伍自身的个性。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da41cb774145fa1af48670bccb6e57ff01c42dfb885551510461b7834e359b63",
      "text": "首先，我们也以“是否适合我们自己”为基准\n来进行挑选，各位觉得如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
